  "description": "Windows RAW printing for Blazor Server and .NET 10 applications. Connects the browser directly to a Windows WebSocket agent with a durable local queue and website authorization. Send ZPL, ESC/POS and RAW commands through one Windows agent shared by multiple applications.",
